    "en": {
      "trackName": "Lights Out: Top Reaction Test",
      "description": "Hold your finger down as five red lights come on. The instant they go out, lift your finger. You’ll see your reaction time in milliseconds. Go too early and it’s a false start.\n\nChase your personal best, race a friend head-to-head on one screen, or see where you rank on Game Center. Every day, players around the world get the same daily challenge.\n\nWant a different test? Work through 500 Pit Lane levels, or switch to Reaction Grid and tap targets as they light up.",
      "releaseNotes": "• Customize your racer with the Winter Grand Prix Pit Pass. Earn winter tires, profile badges, and borders.\n• Fixed two bugs that could keep the season from opening offline and cut off leaderboard messages.",
