    {
      "version": "1.9.4",
      "releaseNotes": "The new version is here! Enjoy an updated home main page layout and a new 2-player mode for the launch timer. The theme customizer has been relocated, and various bugs and minor enhancements have been addressed. You can now customize your leaderboard avatar and show it off globally with your chosen theme!",
      "seenAt": "2026-02-05T11:26:53Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Pit Lane Daily Challenge\nA brand-new daily challenge mode where a spinning wheel picks the tire color you need to catch. Tires fall from the top of the screen — tap the matching color, dodge the rest. Three strikes and you’re out. Everyone gets the same pattern every day, so the leaderboard is a true daily competition. \n\nApple TV Support\nPlay on the big screen with your Siri Remote. Launch Sequence and Two Player modes now work on Apple TV.\n\n6 New Languages\nNow available in Korean, Italian, Turkish, Dutch, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese — 12 languages total.",
      "seenAt": "2026-02-22T08:50:32Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.0.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes & performance improvements:\n\n• Pit Lane milestones — celebrate combo streaks at 5, 10, 20, and 30 with haptic feedback\n• Points bubbles and lane flash effects for better visual feedback\n• New interactive tutorial for first-time players\n• Fixed screen going blank after taking screenshots\n• Improved theme switching reliability\n• Performance and stability improvements",
      "seenAt": "2026-02-24T18:00:37Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.1",
      "releaseNotes": "• Two New Premium Styles\nRetro OS '95 and Terminal — two bold new visual styles. Unlock all styles instantly with a single purchase.\n\n• Remove Ads\nEnjoy an uninterrupted experience — remove all ads with a one-time purchase.\n\n• Hold & Release\nThe launch timer now uses a hold-and-release interaction for a more realistic start.\n\n• Bug Fixes & Improvements\nPerformance improvements, bug fixes, and general polish.",
      "seenAt": "2026-03-16T01:49:18Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes and enhancements. \nGot feedback, ideas or features you'd like to see? Send feedback from the Settings. Thank you!",
      "seenAt": "2026-03-20T06:17:51Z"
    },
