    {
      "version": "2.3",
      "releaseNotes": "• Pit Lane Circuit\nRace through 500 levels across five F1 championships, with Pit Wall gauntlets and qualifying bonus rounds along the way.\n\n• Battle Pass: Season 1\nMonaco Night is here — wet asphalt, neon reflections, and 45 tiers of cosmetics inspired by the Grand Prix's most iconic night.\n\n• Bug Fixes & Polish\nImproved tire glow with colorblind-friendly rendering, fewer customization crashes, and stability fixes across the app.",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-12T15:00:00Z"
    },
