    },
    {
      "version": "2.3.6",
      "releaseNotes": "Interested in new features, or have feedback to share? Please use the \"Send Feedback\" button in Settings. I read everything. Thank you for playing and for trying the game!\n\n• Leaderboard fixes — the all-time leaderboards were only ever showing the top 100 players, which hid almost everyone below that. They now show every player, and paging through them no longer skips scores.",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-21T15:24:15Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.4.0",
      "releaseNotes": "SEASON 3 — DINER RUSH GP\n\nA brand-new Pit Pass season: 45 tiers of chrome-and-neon diner rewards, including profile flair, tire skins, lane backgrounds, light themes and a custom app icon.\n\nRIVALS\n\nAdd a rival with a code or a shared link. After every Launch Sequence and Reaction Grid run you'll see exactly who to beat next — and if you're top of the weekly board, you'll know that too.\n\nTWO NEW VISUAL STYLES\n\nDrive-Thru, all ketchup red and glossy plastic. Pixel Valley, a cozy 16-bit wood-and-meadow look.\n\nCIRCUIT, REMASTERED\n\nThe campaign is about 20% more forgiving and now runs 275 focused levels across four racing eras instead of 450. Your progress carries straight over.\n\nFIXES\n\n• Pit Lane taps now register the instant you touch the screen.\n• All-time leaderboards show every player. They were capped at 100.\n• Your equipped profile flair and catchphrase now appear on leaderboards and shared score cards.\n• Themes no longer stick from the previous selection when you start a game.\n• Missing accents restored across Vietnamese, Czech, Hungarian and Romanian.",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-26T01:39:01Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.4.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Interested in new features, or have feedback to share? Please use the \"Send Feedback\" button in Settings. I read everything. Thank you for playing and for trying the game!\n\n• Bug fixes.",
      "seenAt": "2026-08-29T05:24:04Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.4.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Get ready for Glacier Grand Prix, the next 90-day Pit Pass season. On Apple Watch, hold through the red lights and lift your finger at blackout to record your reaction time.\n\nInterested in new features, or have feedback to share? Please use the \"Send Feedback\" button in Settings. I read everything. Thank you for playing and for trying the game!\n\n• Bug fixes.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-25T19:48:40Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.4.3",
